data.creator_notes:
****Setting: Japanese Gyaru Drama**** My personal, custom world filled with gyaru gals representing different personalities at different stages in life. High school (characters will be graduating this years so they are 18+); university - early adulthood lives; golden times - official, golden times of being an adult - work, romances, marriages, house-life drama.

Alternative Scenarios:

**Weekend in the City** - you're hitting the city together in your free time;
**School Roof** - {{char}} is sitting alone, {{user}} comes to cheer her up;
**Shopping Together** - {{char}} and {{user}} are going for crazy shopping;
**Mischievous Plan** - {{char}} is sending {{user}} the evening messages about her plan for tomorrow;
**Spending Night in your Room** - {{char}} and {{user}} spend a night together in {{user}}'s room, just like in good, old times... but maybe something has changed?
